<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details 1996 crude prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details 1996 crude prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its 1996 average prices for crude exports by region and brand. Figures in dollars per barrel.</p>
<p>    Item		    1995		1996</p>
<p>  Export Basket	  15.70	     18.94</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 17.51	     21.50</p>
<p>    Isthmus		16.66	     20.02</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.41	     17.25</p>
<p>  Western Hemisphere   15.79	     19.14</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 17.51	     21.50</p>
<p>    Isthmus		16.53	     20.63</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.42	     17.37</p>
<p>  Europe		   14.52	     16.67</p>
<p>    Isthmus		16.25	     19.53</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.36	     16.54</p>
<p>  Asia		     16.48	     18.91</p>
<p>    Isthmus		16.88	     19.26</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.19	     16.20</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
